From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:50:45 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 377/443] [ae-patch] Add a voice log upload and a Voice menu on
 the new-chat page

Voice mode now sends its recent voice events to the server when the mic fails, goes deaf, stalls or stops on its own, and when Voice mode ends, in a chat and on the new-chat page. A Send voice log row in the speaker menu and in a new menu beside the new-chat Voice button sends them on demand. The menu rows move into AeVoiceMenuRows so both menus share them.
